DESCRIPTION:The DFS 5K is Saturday\, September 6th at 8:30 AM\, starting be
 hind EIS. In May 2025\, Edgewood DFS awarded a record-breaking $76\,000 in
  scholarships to Edgewood students. This is our biggest fundraiser of the 
 year\, so please consider coming out to run/walk and help raise scholarshi
 p money for Edgewood seniors!!Here is the link to register or to make dona
 tions: https://runsignup.com/Race/IN/Bloomington/EdgewoodDollarsforSchola
 rs5K 
LOCATION:Behind EIS
SUMMARY:Dollars for Scholars 5k
