BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Edgewood High School
DTSTAMP:20260719T042120Z
UID:3795003e-4e28-59ce-8711-438fa6ffeb03
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260113T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260113T193000
DESCRIPTION:Freshmen Families: Last year during 8th Grade Night we mention
 ed that the Indiana Department of Education was still in the process of fi
 nalizing requirements for the new high school diploma and that we would sh
 are more information during this school year. Mark your calendars for Tue
 sday\, January 13th\, at 6:30 p.m. for a presentation in the EHS Auditoriu
 m regarding the new Indiana high school diploma requirements. Freshmen an
 d their parents/guardians are encouraged to attend.Freshmen will watch a s
 cheduling video during homeroom earlier that day as well\, but it would be
  helpful for them to attend the evening presentation to hear the informati
 on again\; and\, we want to provide parents with an opportunity to hear th
 e information as well. We want to ensure that freshmen are well-prepared f
 or their annual scheduling appointments which will take place from Jan. 20
 th-30th. Freshmen will have individual scheduling appointments with their 
 counselor and complete their four year plan for their remaining three year
 s of high school.
LOCATION:EHS Auditorium
SUMMARY:New Diploma Requirements Presentation for Freshman Families
END:VEVENT
